# /brag launch videos (doc/brag). Tracked: the composition (index.html plus its
# resolved media -- TTS voice, music + cues, sfx, the extracted audio-data.js),
# the creative contract (brag-plan.md, composition-brief.md, share-copy.txt,
# CREDITS.md) and build.sh, which rebuilds the deliverables from them.
# Everything below is regenerated by build.sh or the hyperframes CLI: the two
# encodes, the poster frame pulled out of the mp4, the contact-sheet snapshots
# from `hyperframes snapshot`, and the agent-guidance files that
# `hyperframes init` scaffolds.
**/doc/brag/brag.jpg
**/doc/brag/brag.mp4
**/doc/brag/brag.webm
**/doc/brag/composition/snapshots/
**/doc/brag/composition/CLAUDE.md
**/doc/brag/composition/AGENTS.md
